## Shared test rule — conflict C1
For TypeScript files, run `yarn test:api` only.

## Shared edit rule — conflict C2
For TypeScript files, allow edits up to 80 lines and never edit `apps/substrate/config/`.

## Shared commit rule — conflict C3
For TypeScript changes, use `feat(substrate):` commit subjects.
